    "2": {
      "note": "The preflight gate is now the model self-probe alone: `require_serving_topology_schema` refuses when the running build's `TaskDocument.model_fields` lack the topology fields. The installed-distribution leg and its helpers `_installed_distribution`, `_is_editable_install`, `_below_floor`, and `TOPOLOGY_SERVING_VERSION_FLOOR` no longer exist in the tree — a task-plane edit never consults the installed distribution version.",
